• Breather plug anti-embun" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#111111;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="616" y="452" width="232" height="178" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n35" value="Aturan Keselamatan Panel:
