        <mxCell id="n53" value="Catatan Manufaktur PCB (2-Layer FR4, 1,6 mm):
1. Tidak ada tegangan AC 220V di atas PCB (murni 3,3V sinyal &amp; 5V/12V DC).
2. Lebar trace daya &gt;= 1,0 mm, sinyal 0,3 mm, polygon GND di bottom layer.
3. IC memakai socket female &amp; terminal tepi bawah memakai screw block KF301." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#111111;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="706" width="584" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
